{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"c0925e1e-b23f-431f-9cb0-0393c3df3729","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the required analytics events on the registration and offers screens.\n\n**Key changes**  \n- Added proper import of the analytics wrapper.  \n- Introduced flags to ensure each “start” event fires only once per screen visit.  \n- Wired `registration_email_started`, `registration_phone_started`, `loan_amount_changed`, `terms_accepted`, `registration_continue_tapped`, and `offers_scrolled` events using `Analytics.capture`.  \n- Moved the slider event to `onChangeEnd` and used a `ScrollEndNotification` for the offers list.  \n\nDetails of the modifications and which parts of the colleague’s note were applied are documented in the artifact:\n\n[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/c0925e1e-b23f-431f-9cb0-0393c3df3729/ANSWER.md)\n","duration_seconds":216.843752,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":33578,"output_tokens":19382,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":537600,"total_tokens":52960}}}
